    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/38db2cadb2a5e190e467bb8eaaf3694d.poster.avif?t=1722267774\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/38db2cadb2a5e190e467bb8eaaf3694d.webm?t=1722267774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/38db2cadb2a5e190e467bb8eaaf3694d.mp4?t=1722267774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Rap Pop Jump Core</strong> is a hardcore action platformer that demands constant movement, quick decision-making, and simultaneous combat with enemies. Immerse yourself in the vibrant Rap Pop Jump Core city, where the only way to traverse is by leaping from one platform to another. One wrong move, and you'll plummet to your fate. Use your agility and skills to navigate swiftly and escape the city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/2641f878b6932c3e5fb7193f34360e8a.poster.avif?t=1722267774\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/2641f878b6932c3e5fb7193f34360e8a.webm?t=1722267774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015190/extras/2641f878b6932c3e5fb7193f34360e8a.mp4?t=1722267774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Action:</h2>Engage in fast-paced platforming and combat, where quick reflexes and sharp decision-making are essential to survive and progress.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Environment:</h2>Explore a lively and ever-changing cityscape filled with platforms, each requiring precise timing and strategy to navigate successfully.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Challenges:</h2>Confront various enemies and obstacles that add layers of difficulty, testing your skills and keeping you on your toes.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-Based Gameplay:</h2>Master the art of rapid movement and combat, using your abilities to outmaneuver foes and avoid deadly falls as you strive to escape the city's perilous heights.</li></ul>",
